@startuml
title Telegram PMS Bot - Message Sending State Diagram

[*] --> PENDING

PENDING --> SENT : Telegram API returns OK
PENDING --> FAILED : Telegram API returns error

FAILED --> RETRY_PENDING : Retry allowed
RETRY_PENDING --> SENT : Retry success
RETRY_PENDING --> FAILED_PERMANENTLY : Max retries exceeded

SENT --> [*]
FAILED_PERMANENTLY --> [*]

@enduml